  "description": "An embeddable SSH-2 and SFTP server for .NET. A complete, self-contained SSH/SFTP server library written in C# — no native dependencies and no third-party cryptography. Host a secure SFTP server from your own application with your own authentication and storage: password and public-key auth (Ed25519, ECDSA, RSA), SFTP v3, chacha20-poly1305 and AES-GCM/CTR ciphers, post-quantum hybrid key exchange (mlkem768x25519-sha256, FIPS 203 / RFC 10042), strict KEX (Terrapin mitigation), keepalive and idle timeout, events and an ASP.NET-style middleware pipeline.",
